mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me bàn\" data-defn=\"what&#x27;s to be done\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">怎么办</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼辦</span><rt>zěn me bàn</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Mài kè\" data-defn=\"(name) Mike; Michael / (prefix) Mac-; Mc-\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">麦克</span><span class=\"tr\">麥克</span><rt>Mài kè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to think (about) / to think of; to devise / to think (that); to believe (that)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to think (about) / to think of; to devise / to think (that); to believe (that)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rán hòu\" data-defn=\"then; after that; afterwards\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bǎ\" data-defn=\"(used to put the object before the verb: 把[ba3] + {noun} + {verb})\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lín cūn\" data-defn=\"neighboring village; a village nearby\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">邻村</span><span class=\"tr\">鄰村</span><rt>lín cūn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"